---
import PageLayout from "@layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { buildPageMetadata } from "@lib/metadata/pageMetadata";

const metadata = buildPageMetadata({
  title: "About Bashir Salami — Hands-on Technical Leader",
  description: "A cross-disciplinary software engineer and technical leader working across product, systems, data, cloud, and operations.",
  path: "/about/"
});
---

<PageLayout
  metadata={metadata}
  eyebrow="About"
  title="I am a hands-on software engineer and technical leader."
  summary="I have moved across frontend development, backend systems, cloud and platform engineering, data infrastructure, and technical architecture because the problems I work on rarely stop at one boundary."
>
  <section class="reading-shell mdx-content about-content">
    <p>I am most useful when a product needs both implementation depth and systems judgement: when a user workflow depends on a difficult domain model, when a data pipeline affects product behavior, or when deployment and observability constraints change the architecture.</p>
    <p>I still work directly with code, infrastructure, data, design decisions, incident investigation, and code review. Leadership, for me, is not distance from implementation; it is creating enough clarity that a team can make sound decisions and ship reliably.</p>
    <h2>How I work</h2>
    <p>I prefer explicit boundaries, typed contracts, accessible interfaces, observable behavior, and trade-offs that can be explained. I would rather simplify a system than add technology merely to make it appear sophisticated.</p>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
